 "description": "<p>Laser-finish leather bunny uniform in silver or pink, three sizes, with headwear included. M suits 40-50 kg, L suits 50-60 kg, XL suits 60-70 kg - one of the few bunny listings that runs to XL.</p>\n<p>The laser finish is the reason to choose this over flat patent: it shifts tone as light moves across it, which photographs entirely differently. Silver and pink are the two colorways, both leaning costume-display rather than subtle.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Material: laser-finish leather</li>\n<li>Includes: headwear, jumpsuit</li>\n<li>Style: bunny girl one-piece</li>\n<li>Color: silver or pink</li>\n<li>Sizing: M (40-50 kg), L (50-60 kg), XL (60-70 kg)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Order by weight band. The XL at 60-70 kg makes this the plus-friendly option in the shiny bunny category.</p>\n",
 "short_description": "<p>Laser leather bunny one-piece with headwear in silver or pink, three sizes up to XL for 60-70 kg.</p>\n",
